<h2>Check the instructions, not just the listing photo</h2><p>Different mounting systems have different requirements. Rogue's Jammer installation guide specifies a standard wood-stud wall. Decathlon publishes separate guidance for its doorway products. One product's installation rules should not be applied to another bar.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.roguefitness.com/theindex/gear-how-tos/installing-the-new-rogue-jammer-pull-up-bar">Rogue: Jammer installation requirements</a></li><li><a href="https://support.decathlon.co.uk/door-frame-pull-up-bar">Decathlon: door-frame bar support and instructions</a></li></ul>
<h2>Buying outside the UK?</h2><p>These shopping links currently use Amazon UK. Check delivery to your country and any charges before ordering. You can use the mounting checklist with a local retailer; this site does not currently offer a verified US shopping route.</p>
<h2>Ready to use the setup?</h2><p>Use the same bar and grip when comparing holds. Record assisted and unassisted hangs separately so a change of setup does not look like a change in performance.</p><a class="dh-btn" href="/training-log/">Open timer & training log</a>
